    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[About the original site]",
      "links": [],
      "level": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This site was created by Remko Scha (Institute of Artificial Art Amsterdam).\n\n\n\nSome of the material presented here was compiled in the context\nof courses about algorithmic art and its art-historical and conceptual\ncontext, developed by Remko Scha for the Frank Mohr Institute, Groningen\n(2001-2003) and the MA New Media of the University of Amsterdam\n(2001-2005). Jos de Bruin and Jochem van der Spek made substantial\ncontributions to these courses.\n\n\n\nThe term \"radical art\" is due to Van Lagestein.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Remko Scha",
          "href": "http://remkoscha.nl",
          "external": true
        },
        {
          "text": "Jos de Bruin",
